							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I spoke with Qadain briefly last night. &nbsp;He was very approachable, and said he had been waiting for Einalem to log in so he could ask him about what was going on. &nbsp;He said he would ask him to return the account to Azlani, but aside from that, and deguilding him, there wasn&#039;t much else he could do.<br /><br />I appreciate his approach. &nbsp;As a guild leader, its his job to hear both sides of the story, and he&#039;s right, there isn&#039;t much beyond asking him to return it, and deguilding him that he can do. &nbsp;I&#039;ve had good experiences with Apotheosis, how they handle this will speak volumes about their guild leadership.
						</td>
					</tr>
