							Einalem apped Tul-Acharn 4 days after all of these posts and has had spotty attendence in game. &nbsp;I will be guild removing him now. &nbsp;We do not tolerate such behavior in TA either.<br /><br />Thanks for the heads up. <br /><br />Beltran
